 "description": "$0.03 per call (x402, USDC on Base, no account). Use when you need the complete picture of a Romanian company (onboarding, credit, M&A screening) and would otherwise call profile, financials and risk. Romanian company full due-diligence report by CUI in one call (cheaper than three): profile (identity, address, ONRC status, VAT/TVA, CAEN, administrators), yearly financial statements (bilan\u021b ANAF, Altman Z', ratios) and the KYB risk score 0-100 with reasons (insolvency, inactive/deregistered, losses).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "cui": {
    "description": "CUI / CIF (Romanian company tax ID, cod fiscal): digits with optional RO prefix, e.g. 2816464 or RO2816464. Get it with romania_company_search.",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "cui"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
